      "content": "wait really?? i get bad migraines all the time and they hurt a lot but this felt different... it just came on so fast. but i dont have any other symptoms like blurry vision or nausea, just the pain. are you sure it's an emergency? i'm kinda scared to go to the ER if it's just a weird migraine.",
